  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s6: Owner turn began a launch
  s7: Seed waits for the owner
  s8: Owner turn installed Pending
  s9: Clear requested#59; epoch serializer pending
  s10: CheckEpoch observed#59; live BeginEffect still required
  s11: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a turn is launching
  s12: BeginEffect holds create authority
  s13: Clear discarded the queue#59; a turn is launching
  s14: Clear requested#59; wait for the accepted physical effect
  s15: Create answered#59; first input not submitted
  s16: Clear reported a hold and left the launch running
  s17: CheckEpoch observed#59; live input authority still required
  s18: A launch older than the clear created a session
  s19: BeginEffect holds input authority
  s20: First input submitted#59; receipt not committed
  s21: Receipt committed#59; source not bound
  s22: The seed ran after a clear began
  s23: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s24: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  s25: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a new session lives
  s26: Clear discarded the queue#59; a new session lives
